<h2>What the score means</h2>
<p>The 0–100 wellness score is calculated from available biometric signals and model assumptions. It is not a hormone concentration, a diagnosis, a treatment recommendation or proof that an intervention worked. We have not established clinical accuracy against laboratory cortisol testing.</p>
<p>The <a href="/how-it-works/">methodology page</a> lists the score inputs, base weights, baseline rules, update timing and limitations. The <a href="/about/">editorial standards</a> explain our relationship to the product and how corrections are handled.</p>
